{"amendments":[],"summary":"No concrete correctness, safety, or robustness defects found in the reviewed tanksim-6e5.2.2 implementation. I reviewed the helper, state/geometry, snapshot, save-migration, scenario materialization, and affected process-system changes end-to-end, and the full `cargo test` suite passed. Residual risk is limited to intentional semantic shifts from gross to net water volume, but I did not find a specific defect that warrants an amendment."}